### Extensao recomendada no VS Code: "REST Client" (humao.rest-client)
### Clique em "Send Request" acima de cada bloco.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Rota raiz
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Health check (testa a conexao com o MySQL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Listar usuarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Buscar um usuario com os posts dele
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1

### Criar usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Novo Usuario",
  "email": "novo@email.com",
  "senha": "123456"
}

### Login (copie o "token" da resposta e cole nas variaveis abaixo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "winni@gmail.com",
  "senha": "123456"
}

### Cole aqui o token recebido no login
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Consultar usuario logado (protegido por JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar usuario logado (protegido por JWT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Winnicius Editado"
}

### Deletar usuario logado (protegido por JWT)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts

### Criar post
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conteudo": "Meu post novo!",
  "autorId": 1
}

### Deletar post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/1
